&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the technical direction of our frontend architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accelerate design process via AI-assisted tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor other engineers, participate in design and code reviews, and raise the bar for frontend craftsmanship across the org&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re excited about you because you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
