&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the engineering bar:&lt;/strong&gt; Advocate for and apply best practices across availability, scalability, operational excellence, and cost management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor and lead:&lt;/strong&gt; Guide and upskill other engineers, fostering a culture of technical excellence, ownership, and continuous learning.&lt;/li&gt;
