&lt;li&gt;7+ years of professional software engineering experience, with 3+ years as a technical leader driving complex, cross-team projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in building and scaling ad formats or similar user-facing content delivery systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent programming and system design skills, with a proven track record of leading and operating highly available, high-performance, low-latency backend systems at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-native, using modern AI tooling as a core part of how you deliver impact and embedding AI best practices into your daily workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A product builder who understands customers deeply, helps shape what gets built, and turns ambiguous business problems into clear product and technical direction.&lt;/li&gt;
