&lt;p&gt;San Francisco and New York: the pay range for this role is $197,500 to $&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;271,500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;per year.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
